{"1669530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neon Raiders", "steam_appid": 1669530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669530/extras/c66b136b43154c35af3f3919d5fac15f.avif?t=1761051929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669530/extras_big/c66b136b43154c35af3f3919d5fac15f.avif?t=1761051929 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neon Raiders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Mutant Year Zero</strong> and <strong>Miasma Chronicles</strong> comes a  turn-based tactical heist game, built from the ground up for co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think XCOM—but faster, tighter, and fully cooperative.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year? Who cares. The future? Owned by mega-corps and syndicates who’ll kill you for breathing their air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job? Assemble a crew of Raiders, take the highest-paying contracts you can find, and pull off jobs so insane they’ll be telling stories about them for years to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan your moves. Execute in perfect sync. Or die trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No waiting. No handholding. Just high-stakes, turn-based combat where every decision could make you rich - or leave your crew in body bags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This is an early demo of what is to come. We’re exploring new ground with Neon Raiders, and we want to see if there’s an appetite for something fresh and different, especially among co-op players craving a new kind of tactical experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This demo offers around 20–30 minutes of playtime and focuses on the main gameplay mechanics. You can only select between 4 different character classes. Skills, weapons, and other attributes are not available to select in the demo.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>No ship upgrades are available in the demo either.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Come join us on discord to talk with the developers and share tips and feedback!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Co-op Like You’ve Never Seen It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based tactics meet modern pacing: all players plan and act simultaneously. Think fast. Move faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo? You run the whole crew. Co-op? Each Raider’s in your friends’ hands — sink or swim together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heists With Teeth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banks. Casinos. Syndicate vaults. Corporate black sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the prize and run, or push for side objectives to line your pockets. Just don’t forget: if you don’t extract, you lose it all.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Crew. Upgrade Everything.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutes with shotguns. Agile sword-cats. Sharpshooters who never miss (unless it's a 99% chance to hit).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit them with bleeding-edge gear, weapons, and skills to fit your style, stealthy assassin, loud and proud, or a bit of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669530/extras/c66b136b43154c35af3f3919d5fac15f.avif?t=1761051929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669530/extras_big/c66b136b43154c35af3f3919d5fac15f.avif?t=1761051929 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neon Raiders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Mutant Year Zero</strong> and <strong>Miasma Chronicles</strong> comes a  turn-based tactical heist game, built from the ground up for co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think XCOM—but faster, tighter, and fully cooperative.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year? Who cares. The future? Owned by mega-corps and syndicates who’ll kill you for breathing their air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job? Assemble a crew of Raiders, take the highest-paying contracts you can find, and pull off jobs so insane they’ll be telling stories about them for years to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan your moves. Execute in perfect sync. Or die trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No waiting. No handholding. Just high-stakes, turn-based combat where every decision could make you rich - or leave your crew in body bags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This is an early demo of what is to come. We’re exploring new ground with Neon Raiders, and we want to see if there’s an appetite for something fresh and different, especially among co-op players craving a new kind of tactical experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This demo offers around 20–30 minutes of playtime and focuses on the main gameplay mechanics. You can only select between 4 different character classes. Skills, weapons, and other attributes are not available to select in the demo.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>No ship upgrades are available in the demo either.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Come join us on discord to talk with the developers and share tips and feedback!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Co-op Like You’ve Never Seen It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based tactics meet modern pacing: all players plan and act simultaneously. Think fast. Move faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo? You run the whole crew. Co-op? Each Raider’s in your friends’ hands — sink or swim together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heists With Teeth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banks. Casinos. Syndicate vaults. Corporate black sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the prize and run, or push for side objectives to line your pockets. Just don’t forget: if you don’t extract, you lose it all.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Crew. Upgrade Everything.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutes with shotguns. Agile sword-cats. Sharpshooters who never miss (unless it's a 99% chance to hit).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit them with bleeding-edge gear, weapons, and skills to fit your style, stealthy assassin, loud and proud, or a bit of both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "From the creators of Mutant Year Zero comes a bold new take on turn-based tactics: a fast-paced, 1–4 player co-op heist game where you and your crew act as one. Build your team of raiders, take on high-stakes raids, and experience tactical combat like never before, no waiting, just pure action.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669530/83a9e8733a87eb87bb21a20dabf10c7ba873f505/header.jpg?t=1761051929", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669530/71a8e46fb1f1bae461fbc7cc9cd22f47abce3d2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761051929", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669530/71a8e46fb1f1bae461fbc7cc9cd22f47abce3d2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761051929", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-4590 or AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 or AMD Radeon R9 290 or Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7 or AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070 or AMD Radeon RX Vega 56 or Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Gridwork Games"], "publishers": ["Gridwork Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669530/387